[ti:E0062-2 The World Behind the Curtain]
[length:02:11]
[00:00.49]Who
[00:16.04]are you?
[00:22.31]The world
[00:23.11]is full of secrets
[00:27.48]Those with eyes will see
[00:36.76]Those with ears will hear
[00:45.67]Not the imitation made by others
[00:48.79]But eyes and ears made by yourself
[00:55.74]Then behind the world you see
[00:58.46]The true faces and sounds
[01:01.18]You will see and hear
[01:07.18]Without losing your mind
[01:08.54]You cannot find
[01:11.19]That secret
[01:12.87]Reciting a script
[01:14.15]Written by someone else
[01:15.75]Like a parrot
[01:16.55]Just living as if it were your own
[01:21.14]The world
[01:23.70]is full of secrets
[01:27.32]Can you see
[01:30.84]Can you hear
[01:33.59]Can you face
[01:36.36]The real you
[01:42.07]The world
[01:43.99]is still full of secrets
